@RaceDay.Tests_HostAddress = http://localhost:5148

### 1. Test API Health / Get Events (Public)
GET {{RaceDay.Tests_HostAddress}}/api/events
Accept: application/json

### 2. Register Test User
POST {{RaceDay.Tests_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "integrationtester",
  "email": "tester@raceday.com",
  "password": "SecurePassword123!",
  "role": "Organiser"
}

### 3. Login to Retrieve Token
# @name testLogin
POST {{RaceDay.Tests_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "tester@raceday.com",
  "password": "SecurePassword123!"
}

### 4. Use Token for Protected Endpoint
@token = {{testLogin.response.body.token}}

GET {{RaceDay.Tests_HostAddress}}/api/enrolments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json